vFM Player - Per-track gain

SD folder: /vFM/data/track-gain

The player stores each track's MANUAL/AUTO gain records here. Do not edit or share these binary CFG files. No download is required.

Files and instructions:
https://github.com/PanykSystem/vFMPlayer/tree/main/sdcard/data/track-gain

On a PC, use GitHub Code > Download ZIP, then copy the contents of sdcard into /vFM. Keep existing personal settings and recordings.
